@@ -189,16 +189,16 @@
       "id": "US-809",
       "title": "Profile-scoped admin tab URLs: every tab includes profileId in hash",
       "priority": "high",
-      "description": "The admin panel URL only encodes the tab name (e.g. #intents, #responses) but never the active profile. Switching from hostel to cafe profile only updates localStorage Ã¢â‚¬â€� the URL stays the same. This causes cross-profile data bleed: a user on #intents may see hostel intents instead of cafe intents because the API calls use a stale x-profile-id header. Fix: update all profile-specific tabs to include profileId in the URL (#intents/makan-moments, #responses/pelangi, etc.) following the pattern already used by #dashboard/makan-moments/tests. Switching profiles updates the URL; loading a URL auto-switches to the correct profile. Global tabs (settings, whatsapp, staff-review, help) keep the current flat URL.",
+      "description": "The admin panel URL only encodes the tab name (e.g. #intents, #responses) but never the active profile. Switching from hostel to cafe profile only updates localStorage — the URL stays the same. This causes cross-profile data bleed: a user on #intents may see hostel intents instead of cafe intents because the API calls use a stale x-profile-id header. Fix: update all profile-specific tabs to include profileId in the URL (#intents/makan-moments, #responses/pelangi, etc.) following the pattern already used by #dashboard/makan-moments/tests. Switching profiles updates the URL; loading a URL auto-switches to the correct profile. Global tabs (settings, whatsapp, staff-review, help) keep the current flat URL.",
       "acceptanceCriteria": [
         "Navigating to #intents/makan-moments auto-switches to makan-moments profile and loads cafe intents",
         "Navigating to #intents/pelangi auto-switches to pelangi profile and loads hostel intents",
         "When profileSwitcher.switchTo() is called, the URL updates to #currentTab/newProfileId",
-        "Tabs that are profile-specific update their URL on load if profileId is missing (redirect #intents Ã¢â€ â€™ #intents/activeProfileId)",
+        "Tabs that are profile-specific update their URL on load if profileId is missing (redirect #intents → #intents/activeProfileId)",
         "Global tabs (settings, whatsapp, staff-review, help, live-chat) do NOT get a profileId in the URL",
         "Profile-specific tabs: dashboard, intents, understanding, responses, performance, chat-simulator, tests, knowledge-base, workflows",
         "Refreshing the page restores both the tab and the profile from the URL",
-        "getTabInfoFromUrl() returns {main, profileId, sub} Ã¢â‚¬â€� profileId is parts[1] if it matches a known profile ID, else null",
+        "getTabInfoFromUrl() returns {main, profileId, sub} — profileId is parts[1] if it matches a known profile ID, else null",
         "npm run build passes"
       ],
       "technicalNotes": [
@@ -207,7 +207,7 @@
