@@ -859,14 +859,14 @@
       "description": "The current reconnect logic (3 attempts, max 60s delay) is insufficient to prevent WhatsApp account bans caused by rapid connect/disconnect cycling. When the supervisor and Baileys instance both retry simultaneously, hundreds of failed handshakes can trigger abuse detection. A circuit breaker must open after N consecutive failures and enforce a 30-minute cooldown.",
