-      "description": "WCAG 2.2 Success Criterion 2.5.8 (Target Size Minimum, Level AA, published October 2023) requires all interactive UI elements to be at least 24Ãƒâ€”24 CSS pixels. The current webchat widget likely has smaller icon buttons (close, send, emoji toggles) that fail this criterion, creating barriers for users with motor impairments or who use touch screens.",
