-      "title": "Hallucination detection: flag and quarantine AI responses with unverifiable claims before delivery",
-      "priority": "high",
-      "description": "Production AI customer service systems require real-time hallucination detection to prevent incorrect information (wrong prices, non-existent policies) from reaching guests. A detection layer using SelfCheckGPT-style multi-sample consistency checking or a lightweight judge model should intercept responses before sending, routing low-confidence answers to human review.",
