-      "description": "Meta tightened AI chatbot rules in 2026, requiring that bots on WhatsApp Business perform concrete business tasks (answering support questions, booking, purchase advice) and prohibiting open-ended conversational AI without a clear business purpose. Rainbow AI should validate that its system prompt explicitly scopes the bot to defined tasks and reject or redirect queries outside its business domain.",
