-      "description": "WCAG 2.2 Success Criterion 2.4.11 (Focus Not Obscured Minimum, Level AA) requires that when a UI component receives keyboard focus, it is not entirely hidden by author-created content such as sticky headers or fixed footers. The webchat widget uses a fixed header bar that can cover keyboard-focused elements in the message list and input area when users navigate by keyboard.",
