-      "id": "US-922",
-      "title": "WhatsApp marketing message user-level frequency cap: enforce 2-message-per-day limit",
-      "priority": "medium",
-      "description": "Meta enforces a cross-brand marketing message frequency cap where individual WhatsApp users can receive a maximum of approximately 2 marketing template messages per day across all businesses. Rainbow AI has no per-user daily marketing send counter, meaning bulk promotional sends (e.g., cafe specials, hostel promotions) may silently fail delivery for users who already received marketing from other businesses that day.",
