-      "description": "Industry best practice for F&B conversational commerce requires automated push notifications for order status updates (confirmed, preparing, out for delivery, delivered) to be sent within the same WhatsApp or webchat session. Makan Moments Cafe currently receives orders but does not send structured status updates back to the customer after confirmation, reducing trust and increasing inbound status enquiry volume.",
