-      "priority": "critical",
-      "description": "Meta will begin rolling out WhatsApp usernames starting June 2026, introducing a Business-Scoped User ID (BSUID) as the primary conversation identifier in webhook payloads. All systems that currently key conversations exclusively by phone number (JID) must also accept and index BSUID so that conversations continue to be routed correctly once a user enables a username and phone numbers become optional. The June 2026 deadline is mandatory for all API integrations.",
