-      "technicalNotes": [
-        "PDPA Amendment Act 2024 Section 9 Security Principle: https://rajadarrylloh.com/the-personal-data-protection-amendment-act-2024-and-guidelines-on-the-appointment-of-data-protection-officer-and-data-breach-notification/",
