-      "priority": "medium",
-      "description": "WCAG 2.2 SC 3.3.8 Accessible Authentication (Minimum), Level AA, prohibits requiring users to solve puzzles, transcribe characters, or remember passwords as the sole authentication method. If the webchat widget prompts for an OTP, PIN, or CAPTCHA to identify a returning guest, an alternative path (e.g., browser autofill or paste) must be available.",
